OpenReliant is an open-source, faithful engine reimplementation of StarLancer, the space combat simulator developed by Warthog
 and Digital Anvil and published by Microsoft in 2000.

Written in Zig and built on SDL3, OpenReliant renders with Vulkan (Metal on macOS) via SDL's GPU API. It runs natively on Linux,
macOS, and Windows using assets directly from your retail copy of the game.
